#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (SigningState), group (Samba)
#: rc.cpp:335
msgid ""
"Set the signing state. This setting affects the smbclient and smbtree "
"command."
msgstr ""
"Configurar o estado de sinatura. Esta opción afecta as ordes smbclient e "
"smbtree."

